<td>Mostly 3NF</td>
<td>Clean 3NF source + star serving layer</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>SCD decisions</td>
<td>Not considered</td>
<td>Some attributes</td>
<td>Per-attribute table with reasons</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Additivity</td>
<td>Ratios stored/summed</td>
<td>Mixed</td>
<td>Components stored, ratios computed</td>
</tr>
<tr>
