<p><strong>14–16:</strong> publish-ready. <strong>10–13:</strong> solid, fix the gaps. <strong>Below 10:</strong> revisit the flagged chapters before building further.</p>
<h3 id="presenting-the-model-the-10-minute-stakeholder-walkthrough">Presenting the model: the 10-minute stakeholder walkthrough</h3>
<p>A model nobody understands is a model nobody trusts. Walk stakeholders through yours in ten minutes:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>The questions (2 min):</strong> "This model answers these 12 questions" — show the list. Everything else follows from it.</li>
